<title>JAPAN: Toyoda Automatic says to buy up to 4.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Toyoda Automatic says to buy up to 4.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyoda Automatic Loom Works Ltd said on Wednesday that it would buy back up to 4.5 million of its shares or up to 10 billion yen worth of its shares.  </p>
<p>Toyoda Automatic is a manufacturer of industrial vehicles.</p>
<p>The share buy-back plan will need to be approved at a shareholders' meeting scheduled for June 27, the company said.</p>
